    "name": "Surviving Mars: Pioneer",
    "steam_appid": 3558730,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558730/extras/b21f1ac750fe78721d44f3c7d51984d8.poster.avif?t=1747213785\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558730/extras/b21f1ac750fe78721d44f3c7d51984d8.webm?t=1747213785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558730/extras/b21f1ac750fe78721d44f3c7d51984d8.mp4?t=1747213785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Mars is calling\u2014will you endure its unforgiving frontier?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><br>The Red Planet is vast, desolate, and utterly indifferent to your survival. With nothing but your wits, limited resources, and the tools at your disposal, you must carve out an existence in one of the most hostile environments imaginable.\u00a0<br><br><strong>\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\ude80VR Survival Systems:</strong> Monitor essential survival stats like oxygen, nutrition, health, and power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558730/extras/6c43d54205f0e89341d0de7957374e04.poster.avif?t=1747213785\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558730/extras/6c43d54205f0e89341d0de7957374e04.webm?t=1747213785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558730/extras/6c43d54205f0e89341d0de7957374e04.mp4?t=1747213785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80<strong>Resource and Crafting Systems:</strong> Establish and maintain production loops, crafting the tools and upgrades necessary to keep your operation running smoothly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf20Exploration and Traversal: </strong>Discover a compelling landscape with tools like jetpacks, hover bikes, and rovers. Seek out anomalies that will begin to reveal a story that unfolds throughout early access.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u26cf\ufe0fDynamic Contracts:</strong> Fulfill mining and export tasks, earning resources, tech upgrades, and blueprints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0fBase Building:</strong> Plan, position, and manage structures to expand your Martian outpost strategically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558730/extras/f23c0ea4d08dec3ff38fe85e9e652f18.poster.avif?t=1747213785\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558730/extras/f23c0ea4d08dec3ff38fe85e9e652f18.webm?t=1747213785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558730/extras/f23c0ea4d08dec3ff38fe85e9e652f18.mp4?t=1747213785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>For the first time, the Surviving Mars universe has been brought to VR, delivering a survival experience where every decision matters. Join us in Early Access, to help provide feedback as you conquer the Red Planet.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early Pioneers will receive two exclusive in-game posters to commemorate their dedication to the mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558730/extras/b21f1ac750fe78721d44f3c7d51984d8.poster.avif?t=1747213785\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558730/extras/b21f1ac750fe78721d44f3c7d51984d8.webm?t=1747213785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558730/extras/b21f1ac750fe78721d44f3c7d51984d8.mp4?t=1747213785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Mars is calling\u2014will you endure its unforgiving frontier?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><br>The Red Planet is vast, desolate, and utterly indifferent to your survival. With nothing but your wits, limited resources, and the tools at your disposal, you must carve out an existence in one of the most hostile environments imaginable.\u00a0<br><br><strong>\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\ude80VR Survival Systems:</strong> Monitor essential survival stats like oxygen, nutrition, health, and power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558730/extras/6c43d54205f0e89341d0de7957374e04.poster.avif?t=1747213785\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558730/extras/6c43d54205f0e89341d0de7957374e04.webm?t=1747213785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558730/extras/6c43d54205f0e89341d0de7957374e04.mp4?t=1747213785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80<strong>Resource and Crafting Systems:</strong> Establish and maintain production loops, crafting the tools and upgrades necessary to keep your operation running smoothly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf20Exploration and Traversal: </strong>Discover a compelling landscape with tools like jetpacks, hover bikes, and rovers. Seek out anomalies that will begin to reveal a story that unfolds throughout early access.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u26cf\ufe0fDynamic Contracts:</strong> Fulfill mining and export tasks, earning resources, tech upgrades, and blueprints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0fBase Building:</strong> Plan, position, and manage structures to expand your Martian outpost strategically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558730/extras/f23c0ea4d08dec3ff38fe85e9e652f18.poster.avif?t=1747213785\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558730/extras/f23c0ea4d08dec3ff38fe85e9e652f18.webm?t=1747213785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558730/extras/f23c0ea4d08dec3ff38fe85e9e652f18.mp4?t=1747213785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>For the first time, the Surviving Mars universe has been brought to VR, delivering a survival experience where every decision matters. Join us in Early Access, to help provide feedback as you conquer the Red Planet.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early Pioneers will receive two exclusive in-game posters to commemorate their dedication to the mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "The Red Planet is vast, desolate, and utterly indifferent to your survival. Surviving Mars: Pioneer is the first made-for-VR entry in the Surviving Mars universe, challenging you to carve out an existence in one of the most hostile environments imaginable.",
